### Команда: APP JANITOR

**Контекст:** @.cursor/rules/app_developer/mainrule-core.mdc

## Hot path

Remove only orphan APP artifacts and stale references after a bounded inventory. Never delete an active plan, implement, QA or bugfix artifact and never use janitor to hide an incomplete slice.
